      "id": "recap",
      "chapter": "Recap",
      "narration": "So: Wi-Fi is only the last few metres. The internet runs under the sea, the web is just one part of it, and the cloud is someone else's computer. Incognito hides your history, not you, and deleted rarely means gone.",
